00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:20.066 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- L'emprisonnement de migrants

00:01:17.733 --> 00:01:21.300 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour des raisons dmmmmigration

00:01:18.966 --> 00:01:22.500 size:53% position:73% line:53%
contrevient au droit

00:01:20.166 --> 00:01:23.733 size:53% position:73% line:53%
international selon de nombreux

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:24.966 size:53% position:73% line:53%
avocats et experts des droits

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:26.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la personne.

00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:27.400 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Pourtant, eiriron 2000 migrants

00:01:25.066 --> 00:01:28.666 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sont incarcérés, chaque année,

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:30.166 size:53% position:73% line:53%
