00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:31.400 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un peu partout au Canada,

00:01:28.766 --> 00:01:32.633 size:53% position:73% line:53%
y compris au Québec.

00:01:30.266 --> 00:01:33.833 size:53% position:73% line:53%
FRANCE-ISABELLE LANGLOIS, dg,

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:35.066 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Aministie inter. Canada franco.

00:01:32.733 --> 00:01:36.266 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On demande aux provinces

00:01:33.933 --> 00:01:37.500 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de résilier ces ententes-là.

00:01:35.166 --> 00:01:38.733 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Amnistie internationale dirige

00:01:36.366 --> 00:01:39.933 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la campagne "Bienvenue

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:41.166 size:53% position:73% line:53%
au Canada" qui demande

00:01:38.833 --> 00:01:42.366 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aux provinces de mettre fin

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:43.599 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à leur contrat avec l'Agence

00:01:41.266 --> 00:01:44.833 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des services frontaliers pour

00:01:42.466 --> 00:01:46.066 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'emprisonnement de migrants.

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:47.266 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Récemment, la Colombie-

00:01:44.933 --> 00:01:48.500 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Britannique et la Nouvelle-

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:49.733 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Écosse ont décidé de résilier

00:01:47.366 --> 00:01:50.933 size:53% position:73% line:53%
leurs ententes. Mais le Québec,

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:52.166 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'Ontario, le Nouveau-Brunswick,

00:01:49.833 --> 00:01:53.400 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'Alberta et la Saskatchewan

00:01:51.033 --> 00:01:54.633 size:53% position:73% line:53%
